1
00:00:00,530 --> 00:00:02,460
(Penny:)It's just so weird.

2
00:00:02,460 --> 00:00:04,430
(Penny:)Howard Wolowitz
is my friend.

3
00:00:04,430 --> 00:00:07,030
(Penny:)You know, once he tried to
stick his tongue down my throat

4
00:00:07,030 --> 00:00:08,330
(Penny:)and I broke his nose.

5
00:00:08,330 --> 00:00:10,900
(Priya:)That's a little easier
to believe

6
00:00:10,900 --> 00:00:12,070
(Priya:)than he's your friend.

7
00:00:12,070 --> 00:00:14,070
(Penny:)Yeah, tell me about it.

8
00:00:14,070 --> 00:00:17,110
(Priya:)You know, my brother had a group
of friends like this in India.

9
00:00:17,110 --> 00:00:19,570
(Priya:)They dressed up in leotards and
goggles and called themselves

10
00:00:19,580 --> 00:00:21,510
(Priya:)the New Delhi
Power Rangers.

11
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:24,610
(Penny:)You mean when
he was little.

12
00:00:24,610 --> 00:00:27,380
(Priya:)Not as little as
you'd want him to be.

13
00:00:29,750 --> 00:00:31,280
(Mrs Wolowitz:)You know,
this stuff is horrible.

14
00:00:31,280 --> 00:00:33,180
(Penny:)You want to see if we
can find the cafeteria

15
00:00:33,190 --> 00:00:34,590
(Penny:)and get real coffee?
Sure.

16
00:00:34,590 --> 00:00:36,020
(Priya:)We're going to the cafeteria
to get some coffee.

17
00:00:36,020 --> 00:00:37,220
(Priya:)You want anything?

18
00:00:37,220 --> 00:00:39,090
(Leonard:)I'm fine.

19
00:00:39,090 --> 00:00:41,560
(Leonard:)That's nice that
they're getting along.

20
00:00:41,560 --> 00:00:44,060
(Raj:)Your girlfriend and your
ex-girlfriend are hanging out together?

21
00:00:44,060 --> 00:00:47,430
(Raj:)Oh, yeah, that can
only be good for you.

22
00:00:50,500 --> 00:00:51,830
(Leonard:)What are you talking about?

23
00:00:51,830 --> 00:00:53,270
(Raj:)One of them
broke up with you.

24
00:00:53,270 --> 00:00:55,770
(Raj:)Do you really want her
telling the other one why?

25
00:00:55,770 --> 00:00:57,770
(Leonard:)I don't care.

26
00:00:57,770 --> 00:00:59,780
(Leonard:)I don't have
anything to hide.

27
00:00:59,780 --> 00:01:00,910
(Raj:)Good, good.

